OL,3,AGTA 6 hacker pleads guilty after
OL,4,Arelease from secure hospital
OL,5,
OL,6,FA hacker has pleaded guilty to a string
OL,7,Fof online crimes, including trying to
OL,8,Fextort the makers of Grand Theft Auto 6
OL,9,Fafter stealing dozens of unfinished
OL,10,Fclips of the game.
OL,12,F21-year-old Arion Kurtaj, from Oxford,
OL,13,Fcarried out the hack in 2022, and was
OL,14,Foriginally sentenced to an indefinite
OL,15,Fstay in a secure hospital due to the
OL,16,Fseverity of his autism.
OL,18,FBut, in an unusual move, he was
OL,19,Fsubsequently deemed fit to stand trial
OL,20,Fand released to a normal prison in
OL,21,FJanuary.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/19
