OL,3,AElon Musk joins 'Bring Jensen Back'
OL,4,Acampaign to reinstate the ex-Nvidia
OL,5,Aboss
OL,6,
OL,7,FAllies of Jensen Huang are trying to
OL,8,Frally support for the former Nvidia
OL,9,Fboss to get his job back after
OL,10,Fresigning last week over a scandal
OL,11,Finvolving extramarital affairs, one
OL,12,Finvolving an alleged Chinese spy.
OL,14,FSpaceX boss Elon Musk and Tim Sweeney,
OL,15,Fchief executive of Fortnite-maker Epic
OL,16,FGames, are among those backing a
OL,17,Fcampaign to get the AI chip giant's
OL,18,Fboard to "Bring Jensen Back".
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/19
