OL,3,AIntel sued by investors after PC sales
OL,4,Aslump hits share price
OL,5,
OL,6,FIntel, the US chip giant, is being sued
OL,7,Fby its shareholders who accuse the firm
OL,8,Fof hiding the severity of a slump in
OL,9,Fits personal computer (PC) sales that
OL,10,Fcaused its share price to plunge almost
OL,11,F29% in one day.
OL,13,FBillions of dollars was knocked off the
OL,14,Fvalue of the company after it forecast
OL,15,Fdisappointing revenues ahead of its
OL,16,Flatest earnings report.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,109,105,200,160,0,100
