OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,AIntel sued by investors after PC sales
OL,4,Aslump hits share price
OL,5,
OL,6,FShareholders allege that Intel made
OL,7,F"materially false and misleading"
OL,8,Fstatements that failed to disclose the
OL,9,Fslowdown in PC sales and the impact of
OL,10,Fits data centre projects, according to
OL,11,Fa proposed class action lawsuit filed
OL,12,Fin San Jose, California.
OL,14,FThe BBC has contacted Intel for
OL,15,Fcomment.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/19
