OL,3,ARobert Pattinson named as new James
OL,4,ABond actor
OL,5,
OL,6,FRobert Pattinson has been named as the
OL,7,Fnew James Bond - here's an image of the
OL,8,Factor in the role, released on social
OL,9,Fmedia
OL,11,FIn a statement, the 40-year-old British
OL,12,Factor says: "To say this role is a
OL,13,Fdream come true is an understatement"
OL,15,FPattinson will become only the seventh
OL,16,Fperson to play Bond in the official
OL,17,Ffilm series
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/19
