OL,3,ARobert Pattinson named as new James
OL,4,ABond actor
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeaky Blinders creator Steven Knight
OL,7,Fhas been writing the script for the new
OL,8,Ffilm, with Denis Villeneuve due to
OL,9,Fdirect - we don't yet know a release
OL,10,Fdate
OL,12,FIn May, Amazon MGM Studios announced
OL,13,Fthat the casting process was under way
OL,14,Fafter taking control of the Bond
OL,15,Ffranchise
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/19
