OL,3,ARobert Pattinson: How the Twilight star
OL,4,Abecame 007
OL,5,
OL,6,FRobert Pattinson's career is already
OL,7,Fflying high with roles in films
OL,8,Fincluding the Twilight series, The
OL,9,FBatman and The Odyssey, so signing up
OL,10,Fto play James Bond will propel his
OL,11,Fprofile into the stratosphere.
OL,13,FHe's already established himself as a
OL,14,Fleading man, action star and character
OL,15,Factor, which is clearly why he is about
OL,16,Fto play the suave, British secret agent
OL,17,F007.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,163,160,200,105,0,100
PN,11913
SC,0013
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1794844098
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+j 55"k#j 5w;js1
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ARobert Pattinson: How the Twilight star
OL,4,Abecame 007
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt 40, he is slightly older than some
OL,7,Fof the other men reportedly lined up
OL,8,Ffor the role, but he's also the most
OL,9,Ffamous - something the new Bond studio
OL,10,FAmazon-MGM may have favoured, with an
OL,11,Feye on the box office.
OL,13,FHis recent work has garnered both
OL,14,Fcritical and box office success,
OL,15,Fincluding Christopher Nolan's summer
OL,16,Fblockbuster The Odyssey, in which he
OL,17,Fplayed the villainous Antinous.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/19
